      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Cutting agent spend 40 to 50 percent on server logs is a real number, if the baseline is a full production run and not a cherry-picked trace. The test that matters is whether the same task still completes at the same rate after the cut. Free tier is nice, 20 dollars a month is cheap, but a failed task costs more than both."
      },
