        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "Nasiko has launched Open Runtime, an open-source tool that optimizes AI agent spending per task.\n\nBefore a long file reaches an AI model, Nasiko trims non-essential parts, reducing token consumption. In Nasiko's server-log-based test, costs per task fell 40% with no drop in performance.\n\nUsers can also give each agent a budget limit and have Nasiko stop the agent once it reaches its ceiling."
        },
